WEBVTT

NOTE V2500 HPT Disk - Immersion Scan Plan training video (EducationalSequencer story)

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
V2500 HPT DISK
Immersion Scan Plan - Stage 1 - NDIP-1226 Rev F

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:30.000
WHY IMMERSION?
Water = repeatable couplant
Every pulse sees the same 8 inches

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:51.000
WATER PATH
8 inch = transducer focal length
Focal point ON the disk = min beam diameter

4
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:13.000
SNELL'S LAW
18.9 degree to 45 degree at water-steel interface
Perpendicular to typical bore cracks

5
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:36.000
BOTH DIRECTIONS
Defect orientation independence
Each surface scanned twice - 10 passes total

6
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:48.000
ANATOMY - 5 ZONES
E - A - B - C - D
Five surfaces - NDIP Figure 2

7
00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:09.000
THE 0.020 INCH RULE
Step less than half beam diameter
0.020 step on 0.040 beam = full coverage

8
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:34.000
FSH - FULL SCREEN HEIGHT
80% calibration - 20% report floor
Relative, not absolute amplitude

9
00:02:34.000 --> 00:03:00.000
CALIBRATION PHILOSOPHY
FBH-1 -> gain -> 80% FSH
Anchor every signal to a known reflector

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:09.000
EQUIPMENT BUILD
Mount disk - Fill tank - 8 inch water path

11
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:18.000
OPEN SCAN PLAN
Select V2500 Stage 1 preset
5 zones loaded - NDIP-1226 Rev F

12
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:33.000
ZONE E - +45 PASS
Probe sweeps - 0.020 inch radial - 360 degrees
Pass 1 of 10

13
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:43.000
ZONE E - -45 PASS
Mirror reverses - Bidirectional coverage
Pass 2 of 10 - Bidirectional

14
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:55.000
ZONES A -> D
Each surface +/-45 - 10 passes total
10 PASSES TOTAL

15
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:15.000
A-SCAN vs C-SCAN
Time-amplitude vs Position-peak
A finds it. C tells you where it is.

16
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:28.000
LIVE C-SCAN CAPTURE
Peak per position - >=20% FSH flagged
0 indications

17
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:38.000
INSPECTION RESULTS
5 zones - 10 passes - 0 indications
ACCEPT

18
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:45.000
SAVE THE SCAN DATA
Part serial + date - Archive
Traceable record

19
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:49.000
INSPECTION COMPLETE
V2500 HPT Disk - Stage 1

